							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "This page contains snippets you can try out. {{gtClass:name=Pele2svg}} turns Mermaid text into an SVG that GToolkit's Skia can draw, by running [pele](https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele) and [pele2svg](https://github.com/iriyak/pele2svg) as an external process. It needs [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20 or later."
						}
					]
				},
