							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The packages are loaded with Metacello: `Pele2svg` and its tests, `Pele2svg-Tests` (use `load: 'Core'` instead of `load` to leave the tests out). It clones the repository with Iceberg under `pharo-local/iceberg/`:"
