								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtMethod:name=Pele2svg>>asElement:}} answers a `BlSkiaSvgElement`, drawn by Skia. It has the size of the diagram (the width and height of the SVG's `viewBox`), so elements placed side by side, for example in a `BrHorizontalPane`, do not overlap:"
