							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:name=Pele2svgExamples}} shows all of pele's published examples (659: the 58 featured examples, the 520 documentation examples and the 81 layout cases), read from `test/fixtures`. Evaluate `Pele2svgExamples new` and look at its *Examples* view: it lists them by corpus, type and name, and selecting one draws it. The class also has short examples of the basic diagram types and a few checks. {{gtClass:name=Pele2svgFeaturedExamples}} has one example for each featured example (58, named `<type><n>`, for example `c41`). Open the classes in the GT Coder and look at the results. {{gtClass:name=Pele2svgMathExamples}} has one example for each diagram type that can hold a `$$...$$` formula (11), and `withoutMathOption`; they need `mathjax-full` (see **Formulas and narrow layouts** below)."
						}
					]
