							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Pele has options of its own. Give them to a converter as `renderOptions`. `#math -> true` typesets `$$...$$` in a label as a formula (MathJax draws it as paths, so no font is needed). It works in flowchart, sequence, class, state, ER, mindmap, kanban, block, requirement, swimlane and use case diagrams ({{gtClass:name=Pele2svgMathExamples}} has an example of each). It needs `mathjax-full`, which `Pele2svg installDependencies` installs:"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
