							"code" : "Pele2svg new\n\trenderOptions: { #math -> true } asDictionary;\n\tasElement: 'sequenceDiagram\n  participant A as Customer\n  participant B as Billing\n  A->>B: Total $$\\sum_{i=1}^n p_i q_i$$\n  B-->>A: $$\\frac{a+b}{2}$$ ok'"
