							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "An *element snippet* runs Pharo code that answers an object with `#asElement` (a `BlElement`) and shows it right below the code. With {{gtMethod:name=Pele2svg>>elementFor:format:}} the page can hold a formula next to its text. First TeX: the Gaussian integral is a classic, and the line below is typeset from the TeX source in the snippet:"
						},
						{
