								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The same kind of formula in AsciiMath, which is easier to type by hand: `sum_(k=1)^n k = (n(n+1))/2`. `#asciimath` reads it, and `#mathml` reads MathML. The notation is chosen by the `format:` argument, so the text of the page does not change when you change it:"
