								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A formula inside a sentence is a small element in the inline style: the energy of a mass is the one below, and a sentence cannot flow around an element, so a text snippet holds the sentence and an element snippet holds the formula. {{gtClass:name=Pele2svgMathExamples}} has more. The default color is black; give `color:` a lighter one on a dark theme."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "elementSnippet",
